{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Vault Games 的 Contractor: The Clean Up Part II 現於 Epic Games 平台<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，支援 Windows，截止時間為 12 月 2 日 18:00（香港時間）。作品以重型工程機械清理工地為核心，玩家要處理瓦礫、碎裂混凝土及雜物，將混亂現場逐步恢復秩序。</p>\n<p>遊戲中玩家控制一部強力裝載機，於佈滿碎石、破損混凝土與殘骸的建築工地執行清理工作。目標不限於單一位置，而是要收集、運送並清理每個角落的瓦礫與雜物，完成具挑戰性的復原任務，令工地重新回復整潔有序。</p>\n<p>官方簡介顯示，本作以裝載機操作、搬運與工地清理流程為主要玩法，玩家需要按不同復原任務整理現場。遊戲名稱標示為 The Clean Up Part II，內容圍繞清理與恢復秩序的作業；Epic Games 頁面顯示支援 Windows，有興趣的玩家可於 12 月 2 日 18:00 前領取。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"【PC】操作重型裝載機清運瓦礫 Contractor: The Clean Up Part II 限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Contractor-The-Clean-Up-Part-Ii-Io7r5.jpg\" width=\"1200\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"【PC】操作重型裝載機清運瓦礫 Contractor: The Clean Up Part II 限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Contractor-The-Clean-Up-Part-Ii-12kar.jpg\" width=\"1280\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"【PC】操作重型裝載機清運瓦礫 Contractor: The Clean Up Part II 限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Contractor-The-Clean-Up-Part-Ii-Zdr7u.jpg\" width=\"1280\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"【PC】操作重型裝載機清運瓦礫 Contractor: The Clean Up Part II 限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Contractor-The-Clean-Up-Part-Ii-1tcfr.jpg\" width=\"1280\"/></figure>\n<p>遊戲名稱：Contractor: The Clean Up Part II<br/>支援平台：Windows<br/>領取位置：<a href=\"https://store.epicgames.com/p/contractor-the-clean-up-part-ii-1b1b57\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Epic Games</a></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T22:53:22.593011+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":466,"images":4,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T22:41:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T19:37:59.981952+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T22:46:51.867475+00:00","content_hash":"10a875338198a85badcdb732e099d56c10849ddc0c320a89cedbe8e6ad4a7efb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}